## Agent Overview
The `sap-helper` is a specialized sub-agent designed to handle SAP-related tasks including data extraction, report generation, and system queries.

## When to Use SAP Helper
Delegate to `sap-helper` when:
- User requests SAP data extraction or export
- User needs SAP reports generated
